              "content": "Client reports {nausea,} {loss of appetite,|correct} {vomiting, fever, and constipation for the past 2 weeks} and {abdominal pain rated 7/10 on the Numerical Rating Scale for 1 week. Client states, “The abdominal pain started after my 7-year-old child accidentally kicked me in the stomach.”|correct} {Client plays soccer with the child once a week.} {Vital signs: T 103.4° F (39.7° C), P 92 beats/min, RR 22 breaths/min, BP 130/86 mm Hg, pulse oximetry reading 98% on room air.|correct} {No significant past medical or surgical history.} {Body mass index (BMI) of 32.} {Drinks alcohol only during social occasions, usually 3 beverages.} {Smokes cigarettes during social occasions.}"
