              "title": "Nurses' Notes Day 3",
              "content": "<p class=\"nurse-note-row\"><span class=\"nurse-note-time\">Hospital Day 3:</span><span class=\"nurse-note-text\">BP 118/72 mm Hg, HR 88 beats/min, temperature 36.9° C; no orthostatic change. Potassium 3.9 mmol/L. Alcohol withdrawal scores 2&ndash;4. Dermatology plans to start infliximab (a biologic) by IV infusion today. Client states: “I stopped the methotrexate because I lost my job and my drug plan. I hate the way people look at my skin. I really do want to cut down on drinking.”</span></p>"
