          "preamble": "",
          "explanation": "Teaching about the medication schedule and length of treatment, liver monitoring, energy conservation, and how tuberculosis is (and is not) spread is needed immediately.<br>The cholesterol is high and the A1C is elevated but in the prediabetes range. These should be addressed at the follow-up visit, when the client may be more able to receive information unrelated to the presenting problem.<br>There is no need to collect sputum at home since the antibiotics have already been started."
