          "preamble": "At 1430, the provider assesses the client, reviews the chart, and writes orders.",
          "explanation": "The priorities are to reduce the ammonia level with the first dose of lactulose, to promote prompt diuresis of the excess fluid with IV furosemide, and to improve oxygenation by increasing the oxygen to keep the pulse oximetry reading at 95% or greater.<br>The other orders (routine assessments, diet, daily weight and girth, the IV, and the daily spironolactone) are carried out as scheduled.",
