          "preamble": "The nurse has reviewed the Nurses&rsquo; Notes from Day 1 1700 and Day 2 0900, the Vital Signs from Day 1 1800 and Day 2 0800, the Day 2 Laboratory Results, and the Orders. On the second day, the nurse reviews the morning vital signs, urine output, and updated ammonia level.",
