          "footnote": "Taken from the Maryland Next Gen NCLEX Test Bank Project, University of Maryland School of Nursing: &ldquo;Compartment Syndrome&rdquo; medical-surgical faculty case study, stand-alone trend (Dawn Leukhardt, MSN, RN, College of Southern Maryland, La Plata, Maryland, September 1, 2022). Available at https://www.nursing.umaryland.edu/mnwc/initiatives/nextgen-nclex/nextgen-nclex-library/ (Faculty Case Studies).",
